    "custom_liquid_U4VRaa": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  #ultimo-dia-bar {\n    background: #000000;\n    padding: 4px 12px 5px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  #ultimo-dia-bar .ud-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1px;\n  }\n\n  #ultimo-dia-bar .ud-headline {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #f5ece1;\n  }\n\n  #ultimo-dia-bar .ud-timer {\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-feature-settings: \"tnum\";\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    color: #cba55e;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    #ultimo-dia-bar {\n      padding: 3px 8px 4px;\n    }\n    #ultimo-dia-bar .ud-headline {\n      font-size: 7.5px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n    #ultimo-dia-bar .ud-timer {\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"ultimo-dia-bar\">\n  <div class=\"ud-inner\">\n    <span class=\"ud-headline\">Último día &mdash; Hasta 60% de descuento</span>\n    <span class=\"ud-timer\" id=\"ud-tiempo\">00:00:00</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function actualizarUltimoDiaTimer() {\n    const ahora = new Date();\n    const medianoche = new Date();\n    medianoche.setHours(24, 0, 0, 0);\n    const msRestante = medianoche - ahora;\n\n    const horas = Math.floor(msRestante / 3600000);\n    const minutos = Math.floor((msRestante % 3600000) / 60000);\n    const segundos = Math.floor((msRestante % 60000) / 1000);\n\n    const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');\n    document.getElementById('ud-tiempo').innerText = `${pad(horas)}:${pad(minutos)}:${pad(segundos)}`;\n  }\n\n  actualizarUltimoDiaTimer();\n  setInterval(actualizarUltimoDiaTimer, 1000);\n</script>\n{%- comment -%}\n  Fix: las páginas de políticas (Shopify las genera automático, sin\n  esquema de color asignado) heredaban --color en blanco de otra\n  sección, dejando el texto invisible sobre fondo blanco.\n  Esto fuerza los colores correctos solo en esas páginas.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .shopify-policy__container {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 20px 80px;\n  }\n  .shopify-policy__title,\n  .shopify-policy__title h1 {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .shopify-policy__body,\n  .shopify-policy__body h2,\n  .shopify-policy__body h3,\n  .shopify-policy__body p,\n  .shopify-policy__body li,\n  .shopify-policy__body a {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .shopify-policy__body a {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n</style>\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Fix: el widget de \"Localizar pedido\" (app ParcelPanel/CWILL) hereda\n  el color: var(--color) global del tema en sus títulos (h1), dejando\n  el texto blanco sobre blanco e invisible. Mismo bug que las políticas.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  #pp-tracking-page-app,\n  #pp-tracking-page-app h1,\n  #pp-tracking-page-app h2,\n  #pp-tracking-page-app h3,\n  #pp-tracking-page-app p,\n  #pp-tracking-page-app span,\n  #pp-tracking-page-app label,\n  .pp_tracking_form_div,\n  .pp_tracking_title,\n  .pp_tracking_title span,\n  .pp_tracking_tab,\n  .pp_tracking_form_in {\n    color: #1a1a1a !important;\n  }\n  #pp-tracking-page-app input {\n    color: #1a1a1a !important;\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style>\n{%- comment -%}\n  Fix: en el menú móvil (drawer), \"Lo más buscado en hombre\" se corta\n  con guión (\"hom-bre\") porque el texto es muy grande para el ancho.\n  Esto lo achica solo en mobile para que quepa en una línea o rompa\n  limpio, sin guiones.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    menu-drawer a,\n    .menu-drawer a,\n    .menu-drawer__menu a,\n    .menu-drawer__navigation a,\n    .menu-drawer__menu-item {\n      font-size: 1.35rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.25 !important;\n      hyphens: none !important;\n      -webkit-hyphens: none !important;\n      word-break: normal !important;\n      overflow-wrap: normal !important;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
